> > Now that's really unusual though I will assume the swarming of soldier ants 
> > gets you while one only encounters one minotaur.....

Partially.  Minotaurs only start to appear fairly deep.  If you
explore patiently you should have very good armor before
encountering your first minotaur.  Also minotaurs are regular
fast so as long as you are unburdened you have a good chance
with them.  Getting killed by a minotaur means you have been
moving down too fast and you have been carrying too much.  Both
beginner mistakes or a deliberate choice to be too aggressive.

